Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 19:32:18 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 02/13] clip-path: inset() with round corners

Elliptical corners resolved against the inset box and shrunk together when
they overlap, through CssBox as border-radius does. Cargo.lock: the bridge's
lyon dependencies.
